{"resourceIdentifier":"3870","resourceName":"Yangxiang AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Henan Province","description":"Yangxiang Composting Project in Henan province (hereinafter as “the proposed project”) locates in Jiyuan City, Kaifeng City, Nanyang City, Xuchang City and Shangqiu City, Henan province, China. The proposed project introduces new animal waste management systems to treat the manure from 12 swine farms in Henan Province. Ruixing subsidiary will install two animal waste management system, and each of the other subsidiary swine farm will install one animal waste management system, and the manure is treated on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.","location":{"latitude":35.011367,"longitude":112.674357},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-27","endExclusive":"2023-02-27","endInclusive":"2023-02-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3870"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Yangxiang Breeding Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58848"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"04/12/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 24/05/2021 - 23/05/2031"}]}]}